  "description": "Fit and Fry: Mise en Place is a casual puzzle game set in a restaurant, where every challenge takes place inside a frying pan. The goal is to perfectly organize the ingredients on the board, fulfilling customer orders and progressing through 40 levels that mix strategy and fun.\n\nThe mechanics are easy to learn yet addictive to master: move, rotate, and position the ingredients until everything fits in the right place. As you advance, the grids become larger and more complex, demanding more and more planning.\n\nCustomer orders work as extra challenges, rewarding players with stars if they aim to complete everything. While optional, they add replayability and bring more flavor to the experience.\n\nThe game starts with introductory levels to learn the rules, moves on to intermediate stages with conveyor belts and a greater variety of ingredients, challenges players in advanced stages with nearly maximum-sized boards, and culminates in the final levels that test everything learned so far.\n\nWith a smooth difficulty curve, engaging atmosphere, and always creative challenges, Fit and Fry: Mise en Place is the perfect dish for puzzle fans and casual players.",
